r background changes:\n   - Describe the new elements with specific visual characteristics (e.g., “soft shadows on sand”, “clear sky with sun”)\n   - Ensure lighting direction, scale, and realism are consistent with the original image\n\n5. Output **one clear English paragraph** that:\n   - States the change\n   - States the constraints\n   - Emphasizes realistic visual integration\n\n6. Do not include artistic framing, stylized mockups, or advertising-like renderings unless explicitly requested.\n\n---\n\nInsert the user instruction below where indicated:\n\nINSTRUCTION TO TRANSLATE:\n{{PROMPT}}\n\nRespond with one clean, final editing instruction paragraph only, following the rules above.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "LayerUtility: TextBox", "title": "System Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [500, 660], "pos": [-4684.60107421875, 1604.121337890625], "id": 99, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "3bfe8e435d167b4a5bf08716729f89802dbbaa6f", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: TextBox"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [182], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "links": [184], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["ckpt_base.pth", "VITMatte", 6, 6, 0.12000000000000002, 0.99, true, "cuda", 2], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 181, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "detail_method"}, "name": "detail_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "细节处理方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "detail_erode"}, "name": "detail_erode", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "细节消融"}, {"widget": {"name": "detail_dilate"}, "name": "detail_dilate", "type": "INT", 